# REQUIRES: python-api, hdf5
# Checkpoints of a Python simulation (D[python-checkpoints]) on the CPU in
# double precision, scenario cli-to-python of Inputs/python_checkpoints.py.
# `mdir run` stops at step 10 and a Python simulation continues its
# checkpoint to step 20: the state, the energy file, and the trajectory
# equal those of the run that did not stop, to the bit (NVE, NVT, and NPT
# with PME and constraints).
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_checkpoints.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide CPU Double mdir %t cli-to-python | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: mdir run -> Python NVE CPU Double
# CHECK: mdir run -> Python NVT CPU Double
# CHECK: mdir run -> Python NPT CPU Double
# CHECK: checkpoints cli-to-python CPU Double passed
